、光线明亮的儿童主题卧室，看起来诱人且充满生活气息，而现在空着的、略微发光的箱子则巧妙地出现在角落或融入背景中。\",\n  \"text\": \"无\",\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"16:9\",\n    \"开箱即世界\",\n    \"儿童房\",\n    \"家具组装\",\n    \"魔幻\",\n    \"奇思妙想\",\n    \"变身\",\n    \"家居装饰\",\n    \" playful\",\n    \"电影感\"\n  ]\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 192, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 206, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [428.0284423828125, 141.5060272216797], "pos": [146.17066955566406, -282.5927734375], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.45", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "model", "links": [165], "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [11, 0.25, 2.5, "default"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 195, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "conditioning", "link": 204, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}, {"widget": {"name": "nag_scale"}, "name": "nag_scale", "label": "nag_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "nag_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "nag_alpha"}, "name": "nag_alpha", "label": "nag_alpha", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "nag_alpha"}, {"widget": {"name": "nag_tau"}, "name": "nag_tau", "label": "nag_tau", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "nag_tau"}, {"widget": {"name": "input_type"}, "shape": 7, "name": "input_type", "label": "input_type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "input_type"}], "flags": {}, "type": "WanVideoNAG", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [315.380615234375, 160.342529296875], "pos": [667.5365600585938, -605.345458984375], "id": 69, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-kjnodes", "ver": "a6b867b63a29ca48ddb15c589e17a9f2d8530d57", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Nod